British Columbia funds industry emissions reductions to maintain competitiveness. This is environmental intelligence, episode 71. British Columbia is directing funds toward industrial emissions cuts. Federal plans to fast track an oil pipeline to a Salish Sea Terminal introduce new regulatory considerations for marine and pipeline projects. Practitioners should review both developments for immediate compliance effects this week. British Columbia announced funding support for industry to reduce emissions while

